\section{Spin States}

The computational basis states are
\begin{equation}
    \ket{0} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}, \quad
    \ket{1} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}.
\end{equation}

A general qubit state is
\begin{equation}
    \ket{\psi} = \alpha \ket{0} + \beta \ket{1},
\end{equation}
where $\alpha$ and $\beta$ are complex numbers satisfying $|\alpha|^2 + |\beta|^2 = 1$.

